WEBVTT

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:03.093
they secrete a mucus bubble
from a gland in their head

00:03:03.117 --> 00:03:05.728
that envelops their entire body.

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:08.950
This masks their scent from predators

00:03:08.974 --> 00:03:10.562
and protects them from parasites,

00:03:10.586 --> 00:03:11.880
so they can sleep soundly.

00:03:11.904 --> 00:03:13.913
I mean, how cool is this?

00:03:13.937 --> 00:03:15.926
(Laughter)

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.721
So this is a confession
of my love for parrotfish

00:03:19.745 --> 00:03:21.434
in all their flamboyant,

00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:24.689
algae-eating, sand-pooping,
sex-changing glory.

00:03:24.713 --> 00:03:25.808
(Laughter)

00:03:25.832 --> 00:03:29.887
But with this love comes heartache.